Validation control: simulated bubble fraction vs analytical:
- 1F1B: (P−1)/(M+P−1) (time-fraction basis).
- 1F1B-I: slightly lower; formula from paper (P−1)(Tf+Tb)−? — I'll say compare to paper's stated bounds; tolerance ±5% or small tolerance since greedy sim should match static optimum for these strategies.
